 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_747074e42d3de8b7296e",
   "sourceHash": "747074e42d3de8b7296e133eaccd67d23bd4b599b161854367ab38537e77e017",
   "text": "在来到 Kairali 阿育吠陀疗愈村之前，我以为自己永远无法戒烟。草药支持、呼吸练习和自然排毒治疗增强了我的决心，也减轻了我的烟瘾。从宁静的环境到关怀备至的工作人员，这里的一切都非常有利于我的康复。我由衷感激 Kairali 的戒瘾项目帮助我重获新生。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3b51c9368ecf09cbbf6b",
   "sourceHash": "3b51c9368ecf09cbbf6b62b7c99111164eaf66f08142335622e1709caa9d6579",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Jaydon 先生[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d495ece6ca628bdc6873",
   "sourceHash": "d495ece6ca628bdc68738018908085f583a00519d38a7cc7a3c103b7facc1ae6",
   "text": "别墅——最短入住时长为 21 晚",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c248db0b6c22d194a267",
   "sourceHash": "c248db0b6c22d194a26728716f04e267fb2aae93b2226ee26ffbc74eaaaa4ded",
   "text": "价格有效期：2025年4月1日至2027年9月30日。单人：一人入住；双人：两人合住一栋别墅。最少 21 晚。[[OPEN_1]]查看公布的价目表[[CLOSE_1]]。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_07c97abae98de9d2be99",
   "sourceHash": "07c97abae98de9d2be9928b9cb8bf1330ea99343056e57b995b585e44cecdea8",
   "text": "你们是否接收正处于酒精或药物戒断期的患者？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_13fcfeca935b10a65bee",
   "sourceHash": "13fcfeca935b10a65bee73b169b56bd47480515e0eb266f8613b77d63df27637",
   "text": "是的。我们也接收正处于戒断期的患者，戒断过程在院内进行管理。请与医院团队讨论您个人的入院需求。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_18b4709fe8832add36ee",
   "sourceHash": "18b4709fe8832add36eed1cb5a6ddf9f5ae2f41dadfaaa9dede8e2ae28c7529a",
   "text": "如果处于戒断期的患者需要更高级别的医疗护理，会怎样处理？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_82107fd018330253f701",
   "sourceHash": "82107fd018330253f70107c8d6f3515d55c9c5a552b533a76fd25a4de622480f",
   "text": "在 Kairali，戒断过程在医疗监护下进行管理。如果患者的病情需要超出本机构能力范围的急诊治疗、专科评估、检查或重症监护，主治医生/驻院医生（RMO）将评估情况，并根据临床需要安排转诊或转院。急诊和重症监护病例可转诊至 Palakkad 的 Thankam Hospital，检查或化验可根据需要在 Palakkad 的 Pulse Doctors and Labs 安排。交通及适当的陪同由前台团队安排，必要时配备临床人员护送。患者及陪同人员会被告知，可能需要另行支付救护车、护送、医院及治疗费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_80d763a743710b8dffa4",
   "sourceHash": "80d763a743710b8dffa46d23de58d439824e6b920284bf634b6a493f5a9c4d88",
   "text": "以自然方式支持健康减重。促进新陈代谢与消化平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_935d2a4be8933a728592",
   "sourceHash": "935d2a4be8933a7285921698ba035f644eebbc9b9924b6a84821d692d5a84fbd",
   "text": "通过焕活疗法进行深度排毒。恢复体力、清晰思维与活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a9fc34a6a6981c5461de",
   "sourceHash": "a9fc34a6a6981c5461de6ee5b231322666067ca51f37dd8d84be68d129a65bc7",
   "text": "成瘾康复与行为健康治疗 · Madatyaya Chikitsa（奇基察）（Kairali 酒精/药物/烟草戒瘾与康复）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source joins 'Therapy' and 'Madatyaya' with no separator; a middle dot was added between the two titles."
   ]
  },
  {
